{"id":"n62331-3-9","stage":0,"title":"거 · ……的东西","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62331-3-9-1","ko":"와, 컴퓨터 새로 샀니? 멋있다.","zh":"哇，你买了新电脑啊？真酷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦。","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"샀니?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"샀니","audio":"/audio/8ca533770ae038703bee.mp3"}},{"text":"멋있다.","meaning":"真酷、真好看","explanation":"멋있다：有型、出色；这里称赞新电脑很酷。","readings":[{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15989","senseId":"1","lemma":"멋있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멋있다","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d536e6255a4151ea","term":"와","zh":"啊，咦","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3","entryId":"17872","definition":"遇到惊喜时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["와"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"79ca95990baff4c4","term":"멋있다","zh":"帅气、出众；这里形容电脑很酷","audio":"/audio/79ca95990baff4c41958.mp3","entryId":"15989","definition":"帅气、出众；这里形容电脑很酷","pronunciation":["머딛따","머싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/f34481b862543789431c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62331-3-9-2","ko":"이거 우리 형 거야.","zh":"这是我哥哥的电脑。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个。","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我（家）的","explanation":"우리 原义“我们”；说到自己的家人时也常用 우리，中文在这里译为“我哥哥”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"형","meaning":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"（我哥哥）的东西","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式，这里表示某人的所有物；-야 是非敬语判断句末，前文说明所指是电脑。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"3","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们、我家的；这里指我的","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"我们、我家的；这里指我的","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对哥哥的称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某人的东西、所有物","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某人的东西、所有物","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f3a1129f3f996a96767.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62331","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":7,"sequenceScore":-0.0856,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哇，你修好了旧电脑啊？真酷。","哇，你买了新电脑啊？真酷。","哇，你买了新手机啊？真酷。"],"answer":1,"explanation":"컴퓨터 是电脑，새로 샀니 问是不是新买的。"},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是我弟弟的电脑。","这是我自己的电脑。","这是我哥哥的电脑。"],"answer":2,"explanation":"우리 형 거 是我哥哥的东西；거 在这里代指电脑的所有权。"}]}
